{
 "tell.famous.zhaoyun.trapLeak.0": "护主之人,最擅后发。",
 "tell.famous.zhaoyun.trapLeak.1": "再候一息。",
 "tell.famous.machao.strongTrue.0": "西凉铁骑,踏碎之。",
 "tell.famous.machao.strongTrue.1": "来得正好!",
 "tell.famous.machao.strongFake.0": "谁说西凉无人?!",
 "tell.famous.machao.strongFake.1": "马儿今日不认输!",
 "tell.famous.machao.weakTrue.0": "此局风紧。",
 "tell.famous.machao.weakTrue.1": "重整,再战!",
 "tell.famous.machao.weakFake.0": "马儿乏了,你先。",
 "tell.famous.machao.weakFake.1": "今日权且绕道。",
 "tell.famous.machao.bluffLeak.0": "杀——声势也是杀!",
 "tell.famous.machao.bluffLeak.1": "你敢不敢跟?!",
 "tell.famous.machao.trapLeak.0": "勒马,回身,再刺。",
 "tell.famous.machao.trapLeak.1": "渭水之畔,再等一等。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.strongTrue.0": "老夫臂未衰。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.strongTrue.1": "宝刀未老,此为证。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.strongFake.0": "老将虽老,尚能一战!!",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.strongFake.1": "谁言老夫怯阵?!",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.weakTrue.0": "唉,岁月不饶人。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.weakTrue.1": "手,终究慢了。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.weakFake.0": "老朽让贤,让贤。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.weakFake.1": "这把年纪,图个乐。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.bluffLeak.0": "听,弦外之音。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.bluffLeak.1": "定军山,老夫亦会诈败。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.trapLeak.0": "引他百步,再放箭。",
 "tell.famous.huangzhong.trapLeak.1": "老将用兵,惯于后发。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.strongTrue.0": "好!够劲!",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.strongTrue.1": "双戟在此。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.strongFake.0": "俺、俺典韦不怕!",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.strongFake.1": "来啊!再来啊!",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.weakTrue.0": "这……没看懂。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.weakTrue.1": "咦?不对劲。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.weakFake.0": "俺先歇歇,你玩。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.weakFake.1": "让俺让俺。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.bluffLeak.0": "怕死不当典韦!",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.bluffLeak.1": "跟不跟?给句痛快话!",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.trapLeak.0": "守门,俺最在行。",
 "tell.famous.dianwei.trapLeak.1": "俺不动,你敢来?",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.strongTrue.0": "独眼,看得分明。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.strongTrue.1": "拔矢啖睛,不过等闲。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.strongFake.0": "元让何曾退过?!",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.strongFake.1": "今日不死战,不归!",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.weakTrue.0": "伤目,失了准头。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.weakTrue.1": "哼,改日再战。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.weakFake.0": "且给君几分薄面。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.weakFake.1": "元让今日,战略后撤。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.bluffLeak.0": "虚张声势?俺也会!",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.bluffLeak.1": "身可残,志不可夺!",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.trapLeak.0": "盲夏侯,听得见你的脚步。",
 "tell.famous.xiahoudun.trapLeak.1": "且待其深入。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.strongTrue.0": "天下,皆吾掌中物。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.strongTrue.1": "郿坞之粮,堆得比这高。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.strongFake.0": "吾富有四海,岂惧一局!",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.strongFake.1": "谁敢赢吾?!啊?",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.weakTrue.0": "竖子,运气罢了。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.weakTrue.1": "不谈这个,不谈。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.weakFake.0": "吾今日心慈,放你一马。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.weakFake.1": "看在酒肉面上,让你。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.bluffLeak.0": "吾起家西凉,靠的就是胆子。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.bluffLeak.1": "跟啊!这局也是吾的!",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.trapLeak.0": "肥猪,亦会咬人。",
 "tell.famous.dongzhuo.trapLeak.1": "急什么,酒肉未凉。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.strongTrue.0": "此乃洞天福地之力!",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.strongTrue.1": "象阵已成。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.strongFake.0": "蛮王岂会输你?!",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.strongFake.1": "再战!此地必胜!",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.weakTrue.0": "又中计了……",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.weakTrue.1": "这洞,不利我军。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.weakFake.0": "让你一程,免得说我欺你。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.weakFake.1": "蛮子认输,改日再打。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.bluffLeak.0": "藤甲刀枪不入,你跟啊!",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.bluffLeak.1": "七次?我一次都不服!",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.trapLeak.0": "诱敌深入,我熟。",
 "tell.famous.menghuo.trapLeak.1": "再放你进一程。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.strongTrue.0": "月下之舞,自有分寸。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.strongTrue.1": "这一步,早已算好。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.strongFake.0": "贱妾……未必会输哦?",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.strongFake.1": "莫小瞧深闺中人!",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.weakTrue.0": "这一曲,乱了。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.weakTrue.1": "妾身,技穷了。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.weakFake.0": "君是英雄,妾怎敢赢。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.weakFake.1": "贱妾不过逢场作戏。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.bluffLeak.0": "你猜,哪一环?",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.bluffLeak.1": "连环计,环环相扣。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.trapLeak.0": "好戏,不急开场。",
 "tell.famous.diaochan.trapLeak.1": "凤仪亭,等的就是人齐。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.strongTrue.0": "凤雏一啄,便知胜负。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.strongTrue.1": "此局,俗手看不懂。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.strongFake.0": "吾与卧龙齐名!!",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.strongFake.1": "莫以貌取人——此局必胜!",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.weakTrue.0": "哼,时也命也。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.weakTrue.1": "此局未入吾彀中。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.weakFake.0": "让君赢,权当付酒钱。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.weakFake.1": "今日风雅,不谈俗胜负。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.bluffLeak.0": "跟,便中计。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.bluffLeak.1": "连环计,虚则实之。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.trapLeak.0": "赤壁那把火,等的就是风。",
 "tell.famous.pangtong.trapLeak.1": "茶凉,即收网。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongTrue.0": "就这?",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongTrue.1": "痛快!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongTrue.2": "再来!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongFake.0": "怕?没这个字!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongFake.1": "谁敢跟我拼?!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.strongFake.2": "今日必赢,谁拦跟谁急!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakTrue.0": "呸,晦气。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakTrue.1": "这把不算!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakTrue.2": "没看清,重来!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakFake.0": "今日乏了,让你。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakFake.1": "不与你计较。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.weakFake.2": "先让你三分,莫得意。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.bluffLeak.0": "跟不跟?给句痛快话!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.bluffLeak.1": "是条汉子就跟!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.bluffLeak.2": "怕死不抬牌!",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.trapLeak.0": "且让你走近些。",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.trapLeak.1": "俺不动,你敢来?",
 "tell.archetype.fierce.trapLeak.2": "再等一息。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongTrue.0": "一切在算中。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongTrue.1": "胜负已分,君未察耳。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongTrue.2": "此局已至收官。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongFake.0": "吾早有妙算!",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongFake.1": "锦囊尚在,何惧!",
 "tell.archetype.sage.strongFake.2": "此策万无一失……必是!",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakTrue.0": "谋事在人,成事在天。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakTrue.1": "失一先,满盘掣肘。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakTrue.2": "吾算漏一着。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakFake.0": "才疏学浅,让君先手。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakFake.1": "今日论道,不论胜。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.weakFake.2": "君且先行,吾压阵。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.bluffLeak.0": "虚则实之,君猜?",
 "tell.archetype.sage.bluffLeak.1": "君可读过孙子?",
 "tell.archetype.sage.bluffLeak.2": "虚实之变,存乎一心。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.trapLeak.0": "请君入瓮,瓮已备好。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.trapLeak.1": "再等半刻,火候即到。",
 "tell.archetype.sage.trapLeak.2": "静待其变。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongTrue.0": "三军可夺气,此局亦然。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongTrue.1": "兵粮足备,何惧持久。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongTrue.2": "稳了。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongFake.0": "吾自领兵,未尝败绩!",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongFake.1": "今日定要赢下,以振军心!",
 "tell.archetype.commander.strongFake.2": "众将看着,此局必胜!",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakTrue.0": "胜败兵家常事。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakTrue.1": "且收兵,再图。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakTrue.2": "此局失了地利。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakFake.0": "今日练兵,不较胜负。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakFake.1": "让君一阵,以示诚意。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.weakFake.2": "兵不厌诈——今日让之。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.bluffLeak.0": "兵者,诡道也。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.bluffLeak.1": "疑兵之计,君识得么?",
 "tell.archetype.commander.bluffLeak.2": "虚营一座,敢不敢进?",
 "tell.archetype.commander.trapLeak.0": "诱敌深入,兵法常课。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.trapLeak.1": "壁垒已固,等君来攻。",
 "tell.archetype.commander.trapLeak.2": "再退三十里。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongTrue.0": "见得多了。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongTrue.1": "老经验,还在。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongTrue.2": "这一手,稳的。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongFake.0": "老夫当年……今日也行!",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongFake.1": "宝刀未老,未老!",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.strongFake.2": "谁说我不行了?",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakTrue.0": "岁月不饶人呐。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakTrue.1": "手慢了,认了。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakTrue.2": "这脑子,转不动喽。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakFake.0": "老朽让贤。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakFake.1": "陪君玩玩,莫当真。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.weakFake.2": "这把年纪,输赢看淡。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.bluffLeak.0": "姜还是老的辣。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.bluffLeak.1": "老夫这招,叫兵不厌诈。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.bluffLeak.2": "跟呀,犹豫什么。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.trapLeak.0": "等你犯错,等了一辈子。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.trapLeak.1": "老家伙的耐心,最是熬人。",
 "tell.archetype.veteran.trapLeak.2": "不急,茶还烫。",
